<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  Par			 C/S =  Par</p>
<p>	   O/N =  Par			 O/N =  Par</p>
<p>	   T/N =  Par			 T/N =  Par</p>
<p>		   June 17, 1997		     June 16, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  2.38 %     1 month forward =  2.04 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  2.88 %     2 month forward =  2.88 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  3.51 %     3 month forward =  3.40 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  3.91 %     4 month forward =  3.91 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  4.21 %     5 month forward =  4.08 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  4.30 %     6 month forward =  4.25 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
